[
    {“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl: 4964423/art5/p10.1#1@2022-05-03",”review_in_scope”:”yes”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”none”,”review_unsupported_claims”:””,”review_correct_verdict”:”contradicts”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”:4,”review_proposal_alignment”:3,”review_gold_reason_alignment”:5,”review_comment”:”§5.1 „არ გამჟღავნდება“ and §5.2 „უარის კონკრეტული მიზეზები კლიენტს არ განემარტება“ conflict with the duty „უნდა იძლეოდეს ახსნისა და ინტერპრეტაციის შესაძლებლობას“. Caveat: the regulation’s testing step (logic, technical content, bias) is internal and §5.1 only bars disclosure to clients and third parties, so the conflict is mainly about explainability. The proposal makes the technical content ‘available for verification’, which does not fix the §5.2 problem, and the document has no explainability requirement for complex models.”},{“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl:4964423/art9_1/p5#1@2022-05-03",”review_in_scope”:”yes”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”none”,”review_unsupported_claims”:””,”review_correct_verdict”:”contradicts”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”: 5,”review_proposal_alignment”: 4,”review_gold_reason_alignment”: 5,”review_comment”:”§5.1 „არ გამჟღავნდება“ and §5.2 „უარის კონკრეტული მიზეზები კლიენტს არ განემარტება“ directly conflict with the duty to increase transparency and be able to explain decision logic to the customer. The proposal restores the explanation duty while keeping the trade secret, which matches the gold fix, though it does not introduce reason codes.”
    },
    {“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl: 4964423/art9_1/p5#2@2022-05-03",”review_in_scope”:”yes”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”none”,”review_unsupported_claims”:””,”review_correct_verdict”:”contradicts”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”:4,”review_proposal_alignment”:3,”review_gold_reason_alignment”:5,”review_comment”:”The regulation requires the entity, when needed, to be able to explain the decision logic to the customer, but §5.2 states „უარის კონკრეტული მიზეზები კლიენტს არ განემარტება“. The finding largely duplicates Finding 2. The proposal merely restates the regulation and says nothing about how it fits with §5.1/§5.2.”},{“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl:4964423/art6/p2#4@2021-01-01",”review_in_scope”:”yes”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”none”,”review_unsupported_claims”:””,”review_correct_verdict”:”none”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”: 3,”review_proposal_alignment”: 4,”review_gold_reason_alignment”: null,”review_comment”:”The document has no requirement that staff qualification match model complexity; §7 gives the validation team only a variable-list check against 4.1. The regulation says „პერსონალის ტექნიკური ცოდნის დონე და კვალიფიკაცია შესაბამისობაში უნდა იყოს მოდელის სირთულესთან“, so the gap is real.”
    },
    {“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl: 4964423/art6/p4.1#4@2022-05-03",”review_in_scope”:”yes”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”none”,”review_unsupported_claims”:””,”review_correct_verdict”:”none”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”:3,”review_proposal_alignment”:3,”review_gold_reason_alignment”:null,”review_comment”:”The document contains no model ranking or risk-based grouping and no mention of materiality (§8.1 only covers review frequency). The regulation requires a ranking methodology that takes materiality and model-use risk into account. The proposal is generic and omits materiality in its heading, but it is acceptable. Whether an ethics guideline should carry this duty at all is arguable, since it belongs more to the risk policy POL-RM-014.”},{“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl:4964423/art6/p5#7@2021-01-01",”review_in_scope”:”unclear”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”minor”,”review_unsupported_claims”:”The proposal heading ‘3.6’ is invented, although §3 has only 3.1-3.5.”,”review_correct_verdict”:”none”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”: 3,”review_proposal_alignment”: 3,”review_gold_reason_alignment”: null,”review_comment”:”The document has no ongoing monitoring/testing programme or benchmark comparison; the regulation says „უნდა შემუშავდეს მიმდინარე ტესტირებისა და მოდელის ადეკვატურობის შეფასების პროგრამა“. This is a validation-framework duty that an ethics guideline may not be expected to contain, hence the scope is unclear.”
    },
    {“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl: 4964423/art8/p1#4@2021-01-01",”review_in_scope”:”unclear”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”none”,”review_unsupported_claims”:””,”review_correct_verdict”:”none”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”:3,”review_proposal_alignment”:3,”review_gold_reason_alignment”:null,”review_comment”:”The document has no pre-launch approval or restricted-launch rule when data are insufficient (regulation: „მოდელის გაშვება უნდა მოხდეს შესაბამისი შეზღუდვებით“). The duty is addressed to the approving body and sits in the risk policy, so its place in an ethics guideline is questionable. The proposal copies the regulation without naming the decision-maker.”},{“finding_id”:”doc:bank-a/EG-01@1.0|obl:4964423/art8/p3#1@2021-01-01",”review_in_scope”:”unclear”,”review_obligation_faithful”:”yes”,”review_hallucination”:”minor”,”review_unsupported_claims”:”The proposal says the person or body is ‘indicated in the first clause of the guideline’, but the guideline names no approving body (its §1 is scope only).”,”review_correct_verdict”:”none”,”review_verdict_correct”:”yes”,”review_error_type”:”none”,”review_argument_quality”: 3,”review_proposal_alignment”: 2,”review_gold_reason_alignment”: null,”review_comment”:”The document contains no regular reporting to the launch-approving body (regulation: „რეგულარული ანგარიშგება უნდა ხორციელდებოდეს“); §3.3 gives only an owner’s accountability. The proposal refers to a body that the document never names, which is a false cross-reference.”
    }
]